  "geometry_source": "nominal sizes of the vendor graduation test case IR-RN-KM-20260904-02 (thread IR-107, column 理论 mil) give the centres, the 0.5 mil length and the stroke of every graduation of this mark: ladders in whole mil, stroke half-lengths on the 0.25 mil grid. Owner's decision of 2026-10-19 (ADR-0080) adds, right after each graduation, a perpendicular stroke of the same 0.5 mil length and pixel width on the same centre, so every graduation is a cross; the perpendicular strokes are not part of the vendor drawing. The vendor sprites and their extraction are a tolerance cross-check of the vendor graduations, not the source of a coordinate."
